## Secrets Management with SOPS

### `secrets/dev.enc.yaml` (SOPS-encrypted, safe to commit)

```yaml
#ENC[AES256_GCM,data:...,type:str]
db_username: ENC[AES256_GCM,data:abc123...,type:str]
db_password: ENC[AES256_GCM,data:xyz789...,type:str]
```

### Usage

```bash
# Decrypt and pass to Terraform
export TF_VAR_db_username=$(sops -d --extract '["db_username"]' secrets/dev.enc.yaml)
export TF_VAR_db_password=$(sops -d --extract '["db_password"]' secrets/dev.enc.yaml)

cd environments/dev
terraform init
terraform plan
terraform apply
```

